msgid ""
"That table is the **OCS2 MIX / MIT** path (Panthera HT / ARX). **Tianji**"
" (天玑) / **Rokae** (珞石) keep the controller on **position** commands; "
"joint impedance is a vendor `ctrl_mode` on the driver layer "
"(`JOINT_IMPEDANCE` on [marvin-ros2-control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/marvin-ros2-control/blob/master/README.md)). VR comparison: [VR "
"Teleoperation](../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)."
